msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:37
msgid "Bootstrap Prerequisites and Fetch Sources"
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:39
msgid ""
"On supported Linux distributions, build system preparation can be performed "
"automatically via the build system's bootstrap script:"
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:41
msgid ""
"Ensure you have the `curl` program installed. e.g., for Pop!\\_OS/Ubuntu/"
"Debian:"
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:47
msgid "Create a new directory and run the `native_bootstrap.sh` script in it."
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:61
msgid "You will be asked to confirm some steps: answer with `y` or `1`."
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:63
msgid ""
"For an explanation of what the `native_bootstrap.sh` script does, read [this]"
"(./build-phases.md#native_bootstrapsh) section."
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:65
msgid ""
"Please be patient. The bootstrapping process can take anywhere from 5 "
"minutes to an hour depending on the hardware and network it's being run on."
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:67
msgid ""
"If the `native_bootstrap.sh` script does not work for you, please try "
"reading the [Advanced Build](./advanced-build.md) page to install the right "
"packages for your operating system."
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:69
msgid ""
"After bootstrapping is completed, update the `PATH` environment variable for "
"the current shell:"
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:75
msgid "Setting Configuration Values"
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:77
msgid ""
"The build system uses several configuration files, which contain settings "
"that you may wish to change. These are detailed in the [Configuration "
"Settings](./configuration-settings.md) page. For the Native Build we "
"recommend setting these in the `.config` file:"
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:79
msgid "`ARCH=x86_64`"
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:80
msgid "`CONFIG_NAME=desktop`"
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:81
msgid "`PODMAN_BUILD=0` to disable Podman Build"
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:82
msgid ""
"`PREFIX_BINARY=0` to disable prebuilt toolchain [if not supported](#support-"
"matrix-for-native-build)"
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:83
msgid ""
"`PREFIX_USE_UPSTREAM_RUST_COMPILER=1` to [avoid compiling Rust compiler](./"
"advanced-build.md#prefix-rust)"
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:85
msgid ""
"The [build.sh](./configuration-settings.md#buildsh) script also allows the "
"user to specify the CPU architecture and filesystem contents to be used in "
"the build, although these settings needs to be written again every time the "
"script is executed."
msgstr ""

#: src/building-redox.md:87
msgid ""
"Building with `PREFIX_BINARY=0` can increase the build time in hours because "
"it has to compile GCC, Rust and Clang. [See Advanced Build: Prefix Toolchain]"
"(./advanced-build.md#prefix) for more information about the process."
msgstr ""

